cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Exploit Evolution: Reproducible Evidence for Declared-versus-Observed Linux Exploit Mitigations"
abstract: >-
  Thirteen synthetic, local Linux labs spanning i386 and x86-64, including three
  controlled experiments that measure the gap between declared hardening and
  observed protection of a specific operation at run time, with committed,
  hash-anchored evidence and matched controls.
type: software
authors:
